  "reading": {
   "title": "What do you like doing?",
   "text": "At lunch, Hafsa talks with a new friend, Ms. Reed, a music teacher.\n\n\"What do you like doing in your free time?\" Ms. Reed asks. \"I love baking and gardening,\" says Hafsa. \"I also like walking in the park, but I don't like running.\" Ms. Reed laughs. \"I hate running, too! I prefer dancing.\"\n\n\"Why do you want to be a substitute teacher?\" Ms. Reed asks. \"Because I enjoy working with children,\" Hafsa says. \"I am patient, and I like helping them learn. I would like to start next month, but I am still studying English, so I have to practice more.\" \"That is a good plan,\" says Ms. Reed. \"I can help you. You can visit my music class, and we can talk.\"\n\nHafsa is very happy. She wants to go to the class on Monday.",
